error: `#[simjig::test]` needs an `async fn`: the body runs as the simulation's main task
error: a simjig test cannot be `const`
error: a simjig test cannot be `unsafe`
error: a simjig test cannot be generic; name the DUT type in the parameter list
error: the test context is shared: take `&simjig::TestCtx`, not `&mut`
error: a simjig test takes at most one DUT parameter; group several models in one type that implements `simjig::DutModel`
